# Only pyproject.toml and src/ are COPYed into the image, so keep the build
# context tiny: the repo carries ~120 MB of demo gifs/pngs (assets/, examples/)
# and ~100 MB of robot meshes (unitree_deploy/), none of which the image needs.
.git
.gitignore
.github
assets
examples
unitree_deploy
external
configs
prepare_data
scripts
docker
data
checkpoints
docker_data
logs
*.md
*.png
*.jpg
*.gif
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.mp4
__pycache__
*.pyc